      "description": "<p>The creature is turned for 1 minute or until it takes damage. It must spend its turns trying to move as far away from the paladin as it can, and it can’t willingly move to a space within 30 feet of the paladin. It can’t take reactions. For its action, it can use only the Dash action or try to escape from an effect that prevents it from moving; if it has nowhere to move, it can use the Dodge action.</p><p>While the creature is turned, its true form is revealed if an illusion, shapeshifting, or another effect conceals it.</p>",
